  Mode: 123
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Landslide
  Description: 'Rhinos only - four arenas of packed prism ribs to bring down. Your plough breaks
    nothing it touches, but every prism it throws into another destroys both, and here the
    ribs sit a prism apart, so almost every throw is a strike. Space widens the blade - a
    wider blade catches more ribs a pass. Each intensity is a different place - angled
    panes, wide wavy roads, a cage, twisted bands. First team to the target wins.'
